			<div class="content" id="post-content-800868">
									

<p>Soooo … Merlin-syndrome incarnate. Also, he speaks a language that is apparently at least partially based on a programming language. Will he reach Arthur's court?<br />
And I wonder why nobody yet jumped out with the 'Thing from the future prohibited!' line.</p>
<p>How can you estimate his biological age? If you're going the standard way of telomere length, that wouldn't tell you anything, as there's no way of knowing how long will his telomeres get before he (un)dies.</p>
<p>Also, corrected a small mistake, where you used answer in place of ask. Feel free to roll back if desired.</p>
<p>Don't get me wrong, I don't find it bad, just not very interesting. Not voting either way.</p>

